{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40461","headline":"锺陵寒食日与同年裴颜李先辈郑校书郊外闲游 · 曹松","name":"锺陵寒食日与同年裴颜李先辈郑校书郊外闲游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒节锺陵香骑随，同年相命楚江湄。\n云间影过秋千女，地上声喧蹴踘儿。\n何处寄烟归草色，谁家送火在花枝。\n银瓶冷酒皆倾尽，半卧垂杨自不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}